<title>USA: Chancellor Broadcasting Co Q1 loss.</title>
<headline>Chancellor Broadcasting Co Q1 loss.</headline>
<dateline>DALLAS 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>1997			1996</p>
<p> Shr loss		   $0.90     loss	 $2.18</p>
<p> Net loss		  15,432     loss	12,231</p>
<p> Revs			55,854		   25,642</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  18,720		   13,192</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q1 net broadcast cash flow as if the company had completed acquisitions as of March 31, 1997: $19.5 million vs $14.6 million.  </p>
<p>Company issued 8.4 million shares in February 14, 1996 initial public offering, 1.19 million shares in August 1996 to Hicks, Muse, Tate &amp; Furst and 555,556 shares for the OmniAmerica acquisition in February 1997.</p>
<p>Net income prior to payment of preferred stock dividends.</p>
